add('gam_extended_math','default_core_retained','GAM-EWC','Copy GAM optimizer saves g3 clone and introduces use_sgv gate(defaultfalse); core projected direction unchanged with gate off. AS1 learner adds selectable Fisher modes, accumulated normalization and MC Fisher; default batch_empirical plus normalize_accumulated=false preserves intended batch-mean-gradient-square Fisher trace-normalization formula. Zero-lambda fast path irrelevant to GAM lambda2000 table row. Avoid claiming bitwise historical parity: code and RNG traversal differ.',[ref(C,'optimer_PerturabtionType/gam.py',128),ref(C,'optimer_PerturabtionType/gam.py',158),ref(C,'models_LoRAbasedCL/as1_normfisher_gam.py',129),ref(C,'models_LoRAbasedCL/as1_normfisher_gam.py',381)])
